    "10": "In this session, {nama} focused on mastering SQL JOINs to combine relational table records. {nama} also learned solving relational database query case studies.",
    "11": "Today, {nama} focused on executing dynamic SQL queries through PHP scripts. {nama} also learned processing and displaying database query results on web pages.",
    "12": "In this session, {nama} focused on designing architecture and database for a native PHP web project. Besides that, {nama} learned building Create and Read data features with web forms.",
    "13": "In this class, {nama} focused on completing Update and Delete features on the native PHP project. {nama} also learned testing features and refactoring backend code.",
    "14": "Today, {nama} focused on using Git for project version control (commit, branch, push). {nama} also learned introduction to Postman for API request and HTTP response testing.",
    "15": "In this session, {nama} learned understanding MVC architecture in Laravel and installing via Laragon. {nama} also explored creating Models, Database Migrations, and Seeders, and creating Controllers and API routing configurations.",
