    "25": "In this session, {nama} focused on building full CRUD modules with validation and Eloquent ORM. {nama} also learned integrating Blade views and Bootstrap styling on the interface.",
    "26": "Today, {nama} focused on connecting authentication, protection middleware, and search features. {nama} also learned conducting feature testing and controller refactoring.",
    "27": "In this session, {nama} focused on defining topics and requirements specification for final backend project. {nama} also learned designing database ERD diagrams and setting up Git repository.",
    "28": "In this class, {nama} focused on developing database schemas with migrations and model relationships. {nama} also learned creating dummy data using factories and seeders for testing.",
    "29": "Today, {nama} focused on developing controllers and core business logic for backend systems. {nama} also learned implementing strict request validation and exception handling.",
    "30": "In this session, {nama} focused on implementing multi-role systems and user authorization on the project. Besides that, {nama} learned securing backend routes and endpoints.",
    "31": "Today, {nama} focused on performing end-to-end backend testing and database query optimization. {nama} also learned preparing environment configuration and server deployment.",
